<title>USA: S. Central Wtr &amp; Swr Dist, N.C. won by Wachovia.</title>
<headline>S. Central Wtr &amp; Swr Dist, N.C. won by Wachovia.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wachovia Bank  said it won $1.140 million of South Central Water and Sewer District of Harnett Cty, N.C., general obligation water bonds, with a net interest cost of 5.50 percent.</p>
</text>
